# PROJECT: KITS College of Pharmacy for Women — Complete Website & CMS

## 1. Project Objective

Build a premium, modern, elegant, fully responsive institutional website for **KITS College of Pharmacy for Women**, with a complete custom Content Management System (CMS), powerful administration dashboard, AI-ready chatbot, and first-time installation wizard.

Existing website:
https://kitspharmacy.ac.in/

This is a complete redesign, not a minor modification of the existing website.

The project must include:

1. Public-facing institutional website.
2. Complete admin dashboard.
3. Dynamic website theme and branding management.
4. Header, footer, menu and navigation management.
5. Page and content management system.
6. Image, video and document media library.
7. Homepage slider and banner management.
8. AI chatbot management and FAQ knowledge base.
9. Admission enquiry management.
10. News, events and announcements.
11. Academic and departmental management.
12. SEO management.
13. Website settings and configuration.
14. First-time installation and setup wizard.
15. Authentication and role management UI.
16. Mobile-responsive admin and public interfaces.

**IMPORTANT ARCHITECTURE REQUIREMENT**

Build the entire frontend in Lovable.

Do NOT use:
- Supabase.
- Supabase authentication.
- Supabase database.
- Supabase storage.
- Firebase.
- Any mandatory cloud backend.
- Hardcoded external backend dependencies.

The backend will be developed separately later using a custom backend with MySQL.

Use a clean API-ready architecture with mock services and demo data for the current development stage.

Do not pretend that frontend mock authentication, database configuration or file uploads provide production security. Clearly separate demo functionality from future backend functionality.

